Whitney Hodges: um, Google Ads, and feel like there's just kind of a… a missing piece, a missing link. They're like, I don't know if I'm doing it right, or if I'm doing it wrong, I need somebody in my corner to, um, to show me the way, right? And tell me if I'm on the right track, and be able to.

