Whitney Hodges: spot my blind spots. Um, a lot of the photographers that have kind of been in our world as well, I would consider more along the lines of, like, solopreneurs a lot of the time, or maybe they have, like, you know, one team member, something like that.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:16.000
Whitney Hodges: And so, um, you know, it is more cost-effective for them to join the ads accelerators, which are, you know, a one-time initial investment for our services. And then, of course, there's the ongoing ad spend versus Elevate, which, as I mentioned before, is that ongoing.

